SOLUTION 1
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    C(4) 50 mmol/kgw

SOLUTION 2
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    Ca 50 mmol/kgw

MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0

REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 200 in 10 steps

USER_PUNCH
    -headings temperature density
    10 PUNCH TC, RHO

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.out
    -reset false
    -user_punch true

END
